1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,560
(Leonard:)Did something happen today
that's bothering you?

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,900
(Sheldon:)Well, I did mention

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,700
(Sheldon:)the Mars Rover incident
to that FBI agent

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,440
(Sheldon:)and probably cost Howard
his security clearance.

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:13,540
(Leonard:)What?
But why should that keep me up?

6
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,670
(Leonard:)Because you feel guilty?

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,510
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

8
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:22,150
(Sheldon:)So you're saying my insomnia is
caused by a guilty conscience.

9
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,850
(Sheldon:)Actually,
you don't have insomnia.

10
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:25,220
(Leonard:)You're sleeping now.

11
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,350
(Page:)Excuse me?

12
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:28,450
(Leonard:)You're having
a guilt-ridden dream.

13
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:31,120
(Sheldon:)Do you have any evidence
to support that hypothesis?

14
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:33,860
(Leonard:)How about that Gorn
sitting on the couch?

15
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,370
(Sheldon:)That seems fairly conclusive.

16
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:43,840
(Sheldon:)No, Gorn, no.

17
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:46,660
(Sheldon:)That's where I sit.

18
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:51,080
(Sheldon:)Thank you for agreeing
to see me, Agent Page.

19
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:55,080
Thank you for filing a complaint
with my superior, Dr. Cooper.

20
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:57,100
(Page:)I understand
you want to recant

21
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,620
(Page:)your statement
about Howard Wolowitz.

22
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:02,120
(Leonard:)Yes.
Was your statement untrue?

